    "summary": "Use it in any phase on 1 **ADEPTUS CUSTODES CHARACTER** unit of yours that just **destroyed** the enemy unit you picked with [Assemblage of Might](vsdata:ability/adeptus-custodes.auric-champions.assemblage-of-might) as your Command phase started. Then:\n\n- Choose any enemy unit that is on the battlefield. Until your next Command phase starts, attacks by your **ADEPTUS CUSTODES CHARACTER** models against it get +1 to **Wound rolls**.\n- If the unit it destroyed was a **CHARACTER** unit, you also gain 1 CP.",
